---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About StuddyBuddy | Academic Resource Sharing Platform"
  description="Learn about StuddyBuddy, our academic mission, and peer-to-peer resource sharing for university students."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-10">
    <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/70 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-200/60 dark:border-indigo-800 mb-3">
        Our Mission
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        About StuddyBuddy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
        Your Study Buddy, Every Semester. A community-built academic repository empowering college students to discover and organize study materials effortlessly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Why We Built StuddyBuddy</h2>
      <p>
        Every semester, thousands of college students struggle with scattered WhatsApp groups, broken Google Drive links, and unverified past papers when preparing for mid-semester and university final exams. StuddyBuddy was created to solve this fragmentation by providing a structured, search engine-friendly academic directory.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Initial Focus: Parul University</h2>
      <p>
        While StuddyBuddy is built from the ground up to support multiple universities across India, our initial launch catalog focuses on Parul University in Vadodara, Gujarat. We support 20 academic faculties ranging from Engineering & Technology, IT & Computer Science, Management, Medicine, Pharmacy, Law, Design, and Applied Sciences.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Our Core Principles</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Open Public Access:</strong> Visitors can browse and download approved study materials without mandatory paywalls or account creation.</li>
        <li><strong>Accurate Academic Hierarchy:</strong> Resources are strictly categorized by University, Program, Term, and Subject. Exam dates are never confused with upload dates.</li>
        <li><strong>Quality Moderation:</strong> All student contributions undergo administrative review to protect academic integrity and verify readability before publication.</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy & Security:</strong> We respect user privacy with first-party analytics and never sell student data.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
